  title: Top secret experiment resume
  content: "\u0417\u0432\u0456\u0442 \u2116125\n\nToday, an experiment called \"-----------------------\"
    was conducted. The essence of the experiment was to test how well the subjects
    performed tasks and understood human language at different stages of infection,
    and how their brains functioned.\n\n\nBacterium: Enterococus bacteria\n\nDevelopment
    speed: 8 month\n\nMutations:   \"--------------------------------\"\n\nDevelopment
    environment: Cold temperature (-30 - 0 ), humidity.\n\nGas: Oxygen, carbon dioxide;\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDr.John
    Doe"
